meta {
  name: Events - Answer - Get
  type: http
  seq: 195
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of an events space>/events/<cuid of an event>/answer
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Your answer to an event (#1515): answer is yes, replay or no, and null when you did not answer; updated_at is the time of your last change. For the members of the community who can see the event (403 for a person who is not a member, 404 for an event that you may not see). A cancelled event and an event that ended still give the answer that you gave. Ability events:read.
}
